[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Exchange</h2>
~y
Tilgon has brought you to one of the outposts of Terra to collect his bounty and deliver you into 
Martol's control.
<P>
As you stand there, you notice that Tilgon and Rogzel (the Collector) are arguing over something. It
seems that there is a discrepancy over your worth.
<$Config,Donebeenthere0=1>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Make a Suggestion,Tell,SUGGESTION
$Button=Instigate a Fight,Tell,FIGHT







