[TOOSLOW]
The Furies are disappointed with your indecisiveness, they redraw their offer.
$Button=Curse the Furies,DoNothing,0
$Button=Pray For Forgiveness,Tell,REPENT

[REPENT]
~[Iisland.*]
The Furies take pity upon you and ~[Iisland.*]offer you the knowledge of the <I>Arc Spire</I>.<P>
~[IthunderFence.2]

$Button=Refuse the Furies' Gift,DoNothing,0
$Button=Accept the furies' Gift,GetTechnology,149


[FIGHT]
<I>YOU: </I>Hey, Rogzel, Tilgon said that your mom drives a three legged Bulf to church.
<P>
<I>ROGZEL: </I>Noone talks about my mother like that! Tilgon, prepare to die!
<P>~y
Looks like this would be your best chance to escape without being noticed.~.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[SUGGESTION]
<I>YOU: </I>Excuse me, Gentlemen, may I suggest something.
<P>~y
Both Tilgon and Rogzel look at you as though you have no right to speak, but yet they are 
listening.~
.<P>
<I>YOU: </I>I would say that I'm worth at least
$Button= 100000 Geyser Crystals,Tell,BIGBUCKS
$Button= 1000 Geyser Crystals,Tell,SMALLBUCKS

[BIGBUCKS]
<I>TILGON: </I>You know, I'm beginning to like you.  How about we join forces and put an end
to Martol's mayhem? 
<P>
<I>TILGON: </I>I never did like his kind.

$Button=Ally with Tilgon [easier],MissionBegin,defeat1
$Button=Decline Offer,DoNothing,0

[SMALLBUCKS]
<I>ROGZEL: </I>Ha, you see Tilgon, even the Sameron thinks he's worthless.
<P>
<I>TILGON: </I>Prepare to Die, both of you.
<P>
~y
This may be the end my friend, May the furies have mercy on you and give you strength.
$Button= Begin the fight,DoNothing,0

[JOIN]
~y
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
